<div>
  <div class="px-4 sm:px-0 mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-base-content">새 토픽 생성</h3>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/60">
      새로운 토픽을 생성합니다. 제목과 본문을 입력해주세요.
      본문은 마크다운 형식을 지원합니다.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <form action="/topics" method="post">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value={get_csrf_token()}>
      <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
        <div class="card-body space-y-6">
          <div class="form-control w-full">
            <label for="title" class="label">
              <span class="label-text font-semibold">토픽 제목</span>
            </label>
            <input
              type="text"
              name="topic[title]"
              id="title"
              class={[
                "input input-bordered w-full",
                @changeset.action && @changeset.errors[:title] && "input-error"
              ]}
              placeholder="토픽 제목을 입력하세요"
            />
            <%= if @changeset.action && @changeset.errors[:title] do %>
              <label class="label">
                <span class="label-text-alt text-error">
                  <%= elem(@changeset.errors[:title], 0) %>
                </span>
              </label>
            <% end %>
          </div>

          <div class="form-control w-full">
            <label for="markdown-editor" class="label">
              <span class="label-text font-semibold">본문 (마크다운)</span>
            </label>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mb-1">편집</div>
                <textarea
                  name="topic[body]"
                  id="markdown-editor"
                  rows="16"
                  class={[
                    "textarea textarea-bordered w-full font-mono",
                    @changeset.action && @changeset.errors[:body] && "textarea-error"
                  ]}
                  placeholder="마크다운으로 본문을 작성하세요..."
                ></textarea>
                <%= if @changeset.action && @changeset.errors[:body] do %>
                  <label class="label">
                    <span class="label-text-alt text-error">
                      <%= elem(@changeset.errors[:body], 0) %>
                    </span>
                  </label>
                <% end %>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mb-1">미리보기</div>
                <div
                  id="markdown-preview"
                  class="prose prose-sm max-w-none overflow-y-auto rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-3"
                >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-actions justify-end bg-base-200 px-6 py-3 rounded-b-2xl">
          <a href="/topics" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">
            취소
          </a>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
            <i class="material-icons mr-1">save</i>
            저장
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
